# staircase: 2-wide steps ascending 1 row per 2 cols right. Every step is a full
# column of X down to the base, so there is no floating ground. Each step is a
# single-jump hop (1 up / 2 across), well inside the player's jump envelope.
#
# Legend: G = solid ground, X = solid wall, P = one-way platform, H = hazard,
#         D = door (decoration), . or space = air.
